# The build context is assets/ (see images:build in Taskfile.yml), which also
# holds the host config directories mounted at run time -- including
# claude's OAuth session (agents/claude/config/home/.credentials.json) and
# real secrets (env/secrets.env). The Containerfile never COPYs them, but
# without this they'd still be sent to the builder with every build.
#
# Each agent's config/ is listed by name rather than as agents/*/config/:
# a new agent's config directory must be added here.
#
# Named .dockerignore, not .containerignore: that's the file Apple's
# `container build` reads. Deliberately a plain denylist with no `!`
# re-includes, which it resolves differently from Docker (apple/container#1800).
agents/claude/config/
agents/pi/config/
env/
